            <div xml:id="d837">

                <pb facs="0814" n="802" sameAs="frus:frus1943v04/pg802"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">867N.01/1885: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Minister in Egypt</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Kirk</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-07-31T17:00:00-04:00">July 31, 1943—5
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1059. Your 1307, July 23, 9 a.m. For Hoskins from Murray and Alling. We are
                    pleased with your proposed remarks to Ibn Saud but suggest that you eliminate
                    paragraph 6 entirely. [Murray and Alling.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
